# Curse of Bloodletting: "If a source would deal damage to enchanted player, it
# deals double that damage to that player instead." Its replacement matches
# ValidTarget$ Player.EnchantedBy, which resolves through Player.Attachments.
# Shock's 2 damage to ai (the enchanted player) is doubled to 4.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
